@overheard endgame
// SW5, the endgame pool (plans/ending-spec.html section 9): two crew talking about you as you pass, only after
// you choose to stay (the bare condition "endgame", EN2's gate). Bubbles: 60 characters. Named pairs use who:/with:.
// "endgame:early": the news of the week, only in the first two weeks after you stay (RV21).

== overheard
? endgame
A: {me} turned down headquarters. Did you hear?
B: For the Wren? Course they did. Have you had the porridge?   #funny

? endgame:early
A: I was sure {me} would go.
B: You were sure the quiz was Thursday.
A: It was Thursday once.   #funny

? endgame
A: Funny. {me} isn't new any more, is it?
B: Not since about week two. We just kept saying it.

? endgame
A: Saw {me} at breakfast. Looked happy.
B: Ordinary-happy. That's the best sort.   #warm

? endgame
A: Who's the new hands' first stop now?
B: {me}. Obviously. They ask the one who stayed.

? endgame:early time:evening
A: Quiet in here tonight.
B: Everyone's tired from all the not-saying-goodbye.   #funny

? endgame:early pair:friend
A: I had a card ready for {me}. "Good luck out there."
B: Cross it out. "Good luck in here."   #funny

? endgame:early pair:bunk
A: Did you hear {me} come in last night? Humming.
B: People who've decided something hum. It's known.   #funny

? endgame:early pair:senior
A: You'd have signed {me}'s transfer, then?
B: I'd have signed it. Slowly.   #warm

? endgame:early
A: Headquarters must be very surprised.
B: Headquarters can come and try Brennan's Friday dish.   #funny

? endgame
A: Bet {me} gets bored of ordinary days.
B: Nobody gets bored here. We just get busy.

? endgame:early act:meal
A: Save {me} a seat?
B: I always do. Now I don't feel silly about it.   #warm

? endgame:early who:pell with:rina
A: Told you {me} would stay.
B: You said "probably". Then you ate my toast.
A: Nerves.   #funny

? endgame:early who:rina with:pell
A: You cried at the address.
B: Dust. Ship's very dusty.
A: Honestly.   #funny

? endgame:early who:torres-zeke with:calder
A: {me}'s staying, Chief.
B: I know.
A: You're smiling.
B: I'm not.   #funny

? endgame:early who:calder with:torres-zeke
A: I've moved {me}'s name off the transfer sheet.
B: Did it take long?
A: Four seconds. I timed it.   #funny

? endgame:early who:vance with:marrow
A: The transfer paperwork, Captain. Returned, unsigned.
B: My favourite kind, Commander.   #warm

? endgame:early who:marrow with:vance
A: Did the Admiral say anything?
B: Not a word, Captain.
A: He approves, then.   #funny

? endgame:early who:brennan with:dlamini-lukas
A: That goodbye supper I planned. Freeze it?
B: Serve it Sunday. Call it a staying supper.   #funny

? endgame:early who:holt with:mensah
A: You owe me a tea.
B: You never bet, Chief.
A: I didn't bet. I knew.   #funny

? endgame:early who:tomas with:bramwell-basil
A: My bunkmate stayed. Your mentor stayed.
B: That's two people for one person!
A: That's how it works, I think. Sort of.   #funny

? endgame:early who:kovac-zainab with:dahl-mira
A: I'd started a goodbye scarf. For {me}.
B: Finish it anyway. Call it a staying scarf.   #warm

? endgame:early who:halloran-emeka with:pell
A: I nearly wrapped {me}'s mug. In paper.
B: You'd never have got it off the hook.
A: True. That hook's very loyal.   #funny

? endgame:early who:saruth with:holt
A: Your crew is pleased. They are louder than usual.
B: Hm. That's them pleased.   #funny

? endgame:early who:oduya with:nandakumar
A: Everyone's sleeping better this week.
B: Everyone's stopped worrying about {me}.   #warm
